Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.67,0:00:01.87,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}感觉有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.78,0:00:04.57,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}你的身体好结实喔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.68,0:00:06.77,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}没没这回事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.78,0:00:08.68,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}跟其他同事比起来我还算比较瘦的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:09.87,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}是这样吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.68,0:00:12.67,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}果然有在劳动的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.79,0:00:14.69,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}身材就是不一样呢!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.69,0:00:18.68,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}没…没有吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.69,0:00:20.59,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好有男人味喔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.69,0:00:23.69,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}还真有点不好意思耶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:27.59,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}我来帮你把身体洗干净吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:28.90,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}请你先坐到那里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:30.69,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}喔 好!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.81,0:00:33.90,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}这…这里可以吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.91,0:00:34.81,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}可以!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.81,0:00:39.61,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}工作得这么辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.61,0:00:40.91,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}要把身体洗干净才行喔!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.91,0:00:43.71,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}阿 不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.72,0:00:48.81,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}手也要洗干净
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.73,0:01:02.63,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}没想到会变成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.74,0:01:06.64,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}我会把你洗得越来越干净喔!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.75,0:01:17.74,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}抹上好多泡泡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.75,0:01:20.55,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}失礼啰!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:33.66,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}您觉得如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.87,0:01:38.67,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}阿,感觉好 好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.68,0:01:50.77,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}要洗得很干净才行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.89,0:02:00.69,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}手掌也要洗干净
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.69,0:02:03.59,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}不可以停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:10.70,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}人家那里也感觉越来越舒服了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.81,0:02:22.71,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}把手指头竖起来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.82,0:02:24.81,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}阿 好 是这样吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.72,0:02:28.71,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}轻轻地伸进去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.63,0:02:41.73,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}手指头伸进去里面了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.73,0:02:42.83,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.74,0:02:46.73,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}这边也要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.74,0:02:49.73,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}你现在感觉如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.75,0:03:03.75,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}突然间变得好热阿,太太
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.86,0:03:08.55,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}可能是因为热水的关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.77,0:03:14.76,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好舒服阿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.87,0:03:20.67,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}手指头被夹得好紧阿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.87,0:03:23.77,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}把我的身体也洗干净
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.79,0:03:40.69,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}阿,你好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.84,0:04:33.74,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}我快 快不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.75,0:04:35.74,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}阿,人家…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.75,0:04:42.65,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}一直这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:44.75,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}阿 快不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.76,0:04:49.85,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}阿 快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.77,0:05:05.68,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}太太．我也有想要那个的感觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.68,0:05:09.77,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}是吗?那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.78,0:05:13.78,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}我们就来洗得更干净吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.70,0:05:25.60,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}已经变得这么大了阿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.75,0:06:19.74,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}舒服吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.85,0:06:23.85,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}这边也要洗干净才行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.60,0:07:11.80,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}喔 好舒服喔 太太
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.74,0:07:43.83,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好大喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.65,0:08:00.64,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}太太
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.73,0:09:13.71,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}对,就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.74,0:09:25.53,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}喔．好多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.85,0:09:38.75,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}最后让我来把他弄干净吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.87,0:10:02.86,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}多喝一点喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.58,0:10:04.67,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}阿 够了够了够了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.78,0:10:07.77,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}喝这么少怎么可以呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.88,0:10:09.68,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}厉害耶 倒得刚刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.78,0:10:11.58,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.69,0:10:15.59,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}尽量喝喔!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.59,0:10:16.78,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}阿好喝!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.79,0:10:18.88,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}哥也真是过份
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.69,0:10:21.68,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}才刚新婚不久就留下Rio你一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.79,0:10:23.79,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}自己到国外出差
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.80,0:10:24.69,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}就是说嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.70,0:10:27.79,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}对了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.80,0:10:28.79,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}Rio你也喝阿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.80,0:10:29.79,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}我吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.80,0:10:32.79,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}那 你也帮我倒一点好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.81,0:10:33.79,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}就喝一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.81,0:10:36.90,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}真的只喝一点点就好了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.71,0:10:38.80,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}就这么一点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.71,0:10:44.62,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}这个人是达令的弟弟MA君
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.72,0:10:47.62,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}他担心我才刚新婚不久
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.72,0:10:49.62,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}就一个人在家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:50.71,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}可能会觉得无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.72,0:10:51.82,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}所以特地来陪我的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.74,0:11:05.53,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}达令这个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.74,0:11:08.83,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}竟然丢下Rio一个人到国外出差
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.84,0:11:11.74,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}别哭阿,就别气了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.85,0:11:14.74,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.75,0:11:15.74,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.85,0:11:18.65,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}哎呀呀呀呀呀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.65,0:11:19.64,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.65,0:11:22.55,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}你是谁?怎么会在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.66,0:11:23.55,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}是作梦吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.66,0:11:25.65,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}嗯 Rio人家好寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.76,0:11:27.56,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}等 等…等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.66,0:11:28.75,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}你要在这里陪人家喔\N嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.76,0:11:31.66,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}Rio? Rio?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.76,0:11:32.86,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}Rio在这里喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.87,0:11:37.67,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}这 这…我可不是你的达令阿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.68,0:11:44.67,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}RIO ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.69,0:12:28.82,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}嗯你去哪里了阿?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.82,0:12:31.81,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}Rio
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.83,0:12:41.82,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}喔达令
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.84,0:12:49.74,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}怎么啦?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.74,0:12:51.64,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}你是弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.67,0:13:19.57,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}要我的手再继续往下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.57,0:13:20.66,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}不要
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.67,0:13:21.66,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}真的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.67,0:13:24.77,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}嗯 人家好寂寞喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.78,0:13:26.68,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}穿这样会热吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.68,0:13:27.77,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好热 好热
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.88,0:13:29.68,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}真的好热对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.69,0:13:34.59,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好热喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.59,0:13:35.78,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好热
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.81,0:13:57.61,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}达令 不要停
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.62,0:14:14.62,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好棒!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.64,0:14:27.73,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}阿 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.75,0:14:34.74,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}要我再继续吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.85,0:14:37.54,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}达令帮人家脱嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.65,0:14:40.64,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}那我要脱啰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.66,0:14:44.65,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}那 真的可以脱吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.66,0:14:47.85,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.76,0:14:53.76,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}脱掉啰 脱掉啰 脱掉啰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.67,0:14:57.66,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}都已经湿了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.87,0:14:58.86,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.77,0:15:03.87,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}脚抬高
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.88,0:15:10.68,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好想看里面喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.78,0:15:11.88,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}想看吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.88,0:15:12.87,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好想看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.80,0:15:29.60,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}是这里吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.71,0:15:40.61,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}阿 好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.72,0:15:48.71,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}我要吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.85,0:16:18.65,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}这样好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.85,0:16:20.65,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}这里都湿了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.65,0:16:21.85,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}湿掉了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.85,0:16:23.75,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}湿了湿了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.76,0:16:32.66,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}你下面都湿了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.77,0:16:33.86,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}都湿了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.67,0:16:36.76,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}脱掉,把它脱掉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.77,0:16:38.76,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}像这样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.87,0:16:42.57,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}要脱掉啰!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.69,0:16:56.59,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好美阿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.59,0:16:57.58,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}我要看到更多
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.59,0:16:59.78,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}这样有看到更多吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.79,0:17:01.69,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}Rio 我不穿西装了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.69,0:17:02.68,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}我也要脱掉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.61,0:17:19.70,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}换个姿势
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.81,0:17:25.72,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}脚抬高
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.64,0:17:50.63,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}不要…不 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.85,0:17:58.75,Default,,0,0,10,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}不 不 不要
